# LLimit

Native macOS menu-bar usage meter for Claude Code and Codex. SwiftPM executable at `Sources/LLimit`. No third-party packages.

## Placement

- Models in `Sources/LLimit/Models/`
- I/O, auth, polling in `Sources/LLimit/Services/`
- SwiftUI in `Sources/LLimit/Views/`
- `App.swift` only wires `MenuBarExtra` + Settings

## Auth isolation

Each `Account` has its own credential snapshot. Claude and Cursor: `~/Library/Application Support/LLimit/credentials/<uuid>.json`. Codex: per-account `CODEX_HOME`. Cursor CLI tokens are `cursor-access-token` / `cursor-refresh-token` in the keychain. Never reuse one Claude or Cursor keychain entry across two accounts.

## Secrets and network

- File modes: credentials dir `0o700`, `accounts.json` and credential files `0o600`
- No tokens, PKCE verifiers, auth query strings, or bodies in logs
- HTTPS only off-localhost; org IDs via `URLComponents`
- Claude login stays PKCE S256 + state check

## Verification

`Scripts/test_security.sh` after auth, logging, URL, or permission changes. `swift build` and `Scripts/package_app.sh` only on macOS with Xcode / CLT.
